  "releaseNotes": "First release in the Tool Library.\n- Tools: form banner and button designers, custom HTML/CSS editor with live preview, icon generator (PNG/ICO, 16-128 px), SVG icon creator, and image upload with resize and format conversion.\n- Shared icon gallery with 78 icons in categories including hardware, buildings, IT, emojis and circled numbers.\n- Resource explorer to filter, preview and save existing web resources.\n- Saves create or update the web resource, add it to a solution and publish it, with a progress bar.\n- Works without a connection; saving asks you to connect.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Generate HTML/CSS and image web resources for Dataverse.",
